config R9FS_FS
	tristate "r9fs: Rust 9P2000.L file system over virtio (EXPERIMENTAL)"
	depends on RUST && VIRTIO=y && 64BIT
	help
	  A read-only 9P2000.L client file system written in Rust, using its
	  own virtio-9p transport. It is independent of the C v9fs (9P_FS)
	  and its 9pnet transports. Mount with:

	    mount -t r9fs <mount_tag> <dir>

	  If both this and NET_9P_VIRTIO are loaded, a virtio-9p device binds
	  to whichever driver registers first.

	  If unsure, say N.
